  "details": "> I'm using VRChat on standalone Quest only.  \n\n> When I remove an avatar from my favorites on the website, the change is reflected correctly in VR — the avatar disappears from my favorites in VR.  \n\n> However, on the website, the avatar still appears in my favorites list.  \n\n> Even if I re-add the avatar to favorites and then remove it again, the issue doesn't go away.  \n\n> The number of favorite avatars updates correctly on the website, but the removed avatar still shows up in the list.\n\nThis message is a translation from Japanese.",
